## Executive Summary

After 18 months of negotiations, Nexus Industries and Toyota Motor Corporation have reached final agreement on a joint venture to commercialize solid-state battery technology. The JV, to be named "NextGen Battery Technologies LLC," will combine Nexus's proprietary solid electrolyte materials with Toyota's battery manufacturing expertise.

**Key Terms:**
- 51% Nexus / 49% Toyota ownership
- $312M total investment ($159M Nexus / $153M Toyota)
- First commercial production: Q4 2027
- Target market: Electric vehicles (initial), grid storage (Phase 2)

