### Intellectual Property

**Background IP:**
- Each party retains ownership of pre-existing IP
- JV receives royalty-free license to use background IP
- License limited to JV activities

**Foreground IP (JV-Created):**
- JV owns all IP created during JV activities
- Each party has right to license JV IP for non-competing uses
- License fees: 3% royalty on commercial products

**Improvements:**
- Improvements to background IP: Licensed to JV, owned by contributor
- Improvements to foreground IP: Owned by JV

**Freedom to Operate:**
- Nexus may continue non-EV solid-state research
- Toyota may continue non-solid-state EV battery work
- JV has exclusive right to solid-state EV batteries

