## Negotiation History

### Key Concessions

**Nexus Concessions:**
- Reduced ownership from 55% to 51%
- Accepted broader Toyota offtake rights
- Agreed to 5-year lock-up (from 3-year proposal)

**Toyota Concessions:**
- Accepted Nexus board control (3 vs 2 seats)
- Increased cash contribution from $120M to $153M
- Agreed to Nexus CEO appointment

### Issues Resolved

| Issue | Nexus Position | Toyota Position | Resolution |
|-------|----------------|-----------------|------------|
| Ownership | 55% | 50% | 51% |
| Board Control | 4 seats | 3 seats | 3-2 Nexus majority |
| IP Valuation | $100M | $60M | $79M |
| Offtake % | 50% | 75% | 60% |
| Lock-up | 3 years | 7 years | 5 years |
| Facility Location | Albuquerque | San Antonio | San Antonio |

